    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isn't temporary? what if some things just... they just change you? i feel like i've lost the right to even try to \"rebuild\" because the version of me that exists now is just toxic. it's like once you've caused that kind of damage, you're just a liability to everyone around you. having a \"future\" just feels like more time for me to mess things up for someone else. wouldn't it be more merciful if people like me just weren't an option anymore?",
